<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Demand moderate. Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 53.50-55.00, liberal volume 54.00-54.50 US 2-3 230-260 lbs. 52.50-53.50</p>
<p>SOWS: mostly steady US 1-3 300-450 lbs. 42.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs. 46.00-49.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 50.00-54.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 53.00-55.00</p>
</text>
